Files derived from the demo, and how they differ from it:

  code.hpp    The game, rewritten from Bend into the claws subset of C++.
              Coordinates are 32-bit unsigned integers instead of
              natural numbers, and four diagonal moves are added to the
              demo's four, without cutting corners. The level as text is
              left out.
  LAWS.lean   The demo's laws, restated in Lean about the C++ version.
  PROOF.lean  New proofs in Lean, following the demo's invariant.
  Code.lean   Generated from code.hpp by claws-lean.
  Ast.lean    Generated from code.hpp by claws-ast.

main.cpp, a terminal driver that replaces the demo's web front end, and
Verdict.lean are new.
